---
name: subscribe_email
to: '{{ form.properties.email }}'
delay: 0
enabled: true
trigger_condition: true
from: >
    {%- include 'modules/insites_core/email_layout/autoresponder_from' -%}
reply_to: >
    {%- include 'modules/insites_core/email_layout/autoresponder_reply_to' -%}
cc:
bcc:
subject: Thank you for subscribing to Insites Template!
layout: modules/insites_core/insites_admin/insites_external_email_layout
---
{%- comment -%}
Email content codes are provided by the designers.

- Below should be the code for just the "email content / body".
- You can use the liquid filter 'html_safe' to manage the content with liquid
and still render the content as html.
[ie. <p>{{ greeting | html_safe }}</p>]
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- assign title = "Thank you for subscribing!" -%}
{%- assign cta = "CONTACT US" -%}
{%- capture cta_link -%}{{ platform_context.host }}/contact-us{%- endcapture -%}

{%- capture greeting -%}Hi there,{%- endcapture -%}
{%- capture content -%}
    <span style="text-align: center;">{{ greeting }}</span><br />
    Thank you for subscribing to Insites. We're one step further to growing your business! <br>
    Let us know how we can help you. We look forward to hearing from you soon!
{%- endcapture -%}

{%- capture subcontent -%}
    <center data-parsed="" style="min-width:200px; width:50%; margin: 0 auto;">
        <br />
        <a ice:editable="link" href="{{ cta_link }}" target="_blank" align="center" class="float-center" style="Margin:0;background:#f36;border:0 solid #f36;border-radius:5px;color:#fff;display:block;font-family:arial;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:1px;line-height:17px;margin:0;padding:12px 0;text-align:center;text-decoration:none">
            {{ cta }}
        </a>
    </center>
{%- endcapture -%}


{%- include 'modules/insites_core/email_layout/autoresponder_content',
    title: "Thank you for subscribing!"
    content: content,
    subcontent: "" -%}